    "US coinage composition -- public facts, seedable from mint specifications.",
    "Composition is a matter of legislation, so it resolves from denomination,",
    "country and year rather than being recorded per item. A dime struck in 1963",
    "is 90% silver because the law said so, not because anyone typed it in.",
